{"name": "At Run Time", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>At Run Time</strong> is a fast-paced parkour game where you take on the role of a <strong>Runner</strong> who has stolen a powerful generator from a gold refinery. The stolen power source continuously builds up energy and is destined to explode, turning every run into a deadly race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotating blades, crushing hammers, fire-spewing pipes, and the ever-present threat of detonation stand between you and freedom. Power up <strong>traps</strong> throughout each level to gain precious extra seconds. Choose carefully, however, every advantage comes with deadly consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for <strong>experienced players</strong> and speedrunning enthusiasts, <strong>At Run Time</strong> features a fluid movement system that is easy to learn but challenging to master. Compete against players worldwide through <strong>online leaderboards</strong> that rank each level based on completion time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/b4e123177de1de5cc09e70936536dea4.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1024\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MASTER ADVANCED PARKOUR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/709c64fa89b2c308cb118e616e2dec3a.poster.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/709c64fa89b2c308cb118e616e2dec3a.webm?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/709c64fa89b2c308cb118e616e2dec3a.mp4?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Combine advanced movement techniques such as wall jumps, slides, and vaults to overcome a brutal environment filled with obstacles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE DEADLY MECHANICAL TRAPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/bbd50f148c6717fc69d0d2ecdce6576f.poster.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/bbd50f148c6717fc69d0d2ecdce6576f.webm?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/bbd50f148c6717fc69d0d2ecdce6576f.mp4?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dodge rotating blades, crushing hammers, and countless lethal hazards hidden throughout the refinery.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MANAGE THE TIMER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/ebe8e7fa0a7ea55398586f70f809d725.poster.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/ebe8e7fa0a7ea55398586f70f809d725.webm?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/ebe8e7fa0a7ea55398586f70f809d725.mp4?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Time is always running out. Activate traps to earn precious extra seconds but beware of \u00a0the dangerous effects they unleash.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPERIENCE SEAMLESS PROGRESSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/7d9f95e09e82a7ac97078cf3569636df.poster.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/7d9f95e09e82a7ac97078cf3569636df.webm?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/7d9f95e09e82a7ac97078cf3569636df.mp4?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Race through each level without interruption thanks to a completely loading-screen-free experience.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILT FOR SPEEDRUNNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/9f424bcfc38b23d1d8d8701edb31396c.poster.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/9f424bcfc38b23d1d8d8701edb31396c.webm?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/9f424bcfc38b23d1d8d8701edb31396c.mp4?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Optimize your routes, master every movement, and discover risky shortcuts to achieve record-breaking times.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PURE MOVEMENT-DRIVEN GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/a47ab3db18c79451fdeb7adbca644ab1.poster.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/a47ab3db18c79451fdeb7adbca644ab1.webm?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/a47ab3db18c79451fdeb7adbca644ab1.mp4?t=1782788541\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No combat. No weapons. Survival depends entirely on your precision, reflexes, and mastery of movement.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/extras/b4e123177de1de5cc09e70936536dea4.avif?t=1782788541\" width=\"1024\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "At Run Time is a first-person parkour game focused on speed, precision, and risk-taking. After stealing an energy source from a smuggler\u2019s hideout, escape through deadly traps using advanced movement skills before time runs out.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660630/2966ad07e83fb16639cf3234796b7f69d861d87a/header.jpg?t=1782788541", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Parkour", "Action", "First-Person", "Score Attack", "3D", "Platformer"], "developers": "Team Maul", "publishers": "Team Maul", "release_date": "Jun 29, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4660630", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 June 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/iE2pAsp6yms", "first_seen": 1782684000.0, "review_rank": 356}